                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ9bDf1BqpQjQRDjOeRXSNuvg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RelVtVkdZMmhQZEhSalgwc3dkV0pxVnpBM2FsRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The owner of this shop is kind, unassuming and very friendly! When my dad had a health scare, she went so far as to call cabs for my other family members. She is also warm and cheerful in a way few other baristas in Taiwan are, showing us nearby interesting places (she’s a Wanhua native).\n\nWe loved the brown sugar and chocolate lattes and apple macchiato, as well as their apple toast and cinnamon rolls, and the owner’s friendship and kindness!\n\nThank you Xiaole, and hoping your business grows in years to come! We will visit again someday!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
